    clock and power-domain offsets, QSCRATCH, the repeater's PPID, the DWC3 base); the core-clocked rule is PianoDwc3's clocksOn().
  package/PianoPower/SpmiObserver.h (sha256 4805d4fb7af91c210d75b9791e125f3789b7671e895afe6f80af27a36a849b07) and ChargerPmic.h (sha256
    46fc0c720f26d0323fd4145cd6cbd3c0349043164c601e96852341b8819b94d4): included, not copied (the SPMI observer read, the charger and
